{"i":25,"text":"Say who the answer is for, so it matches their level.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.audience"},
{"i":26,"text":"For health questions, ask it to cite sources you can check.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.cite"},
{"i":27,"text":"Served, but extra instructions nobody asked for slow the answer down.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.cluttered"},
{"i":28,"text":"Ask for a format, like 3 steps, a list or a table.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.format"},
{"i":29,"text":"Name the language you want, or the AI will pick one for you.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.language"},
{"i":30,"text":"Say how long: short, 3 sentences, one paragraph.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.length"},
{"i":31,"text":"Only add what the customer asked for. Extra rules confuse the AI.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.muddled"},
{"i":32,"text":"A good prompt is a good recipe: clear parts, clear dish.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.perfect"},
{"i":33,"text":"A clear prompt, with sources and honesty, still needs a check with a health worker.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.perfectHealth"},
{"i":34,"text":"Give it a role, like nurse or teacher, to set the tone.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.role"},
{"i":35,"text":"Ask it to say if it is unsure, so guesses do not sound like facts.","where":"ui:g.luto.lesson.unsure"},
{"i":36,"text":"NO DISH: THE CUSTOMER LEFT HUNGRY","where":"ui:g.luto.noDish"},
{"i":37,"text":"THINK OF THE PARTS FIRST: WHO, LANGUAGE, LENGTH, FORMAT.","where":"ui:g.luto.noDishLesson"},
