{"i":47,"text":"For health questions, ask it to cite sources and to say if it is unsure. That makes its answer easier to check.","where":"ui:g.luto.recap.health"},
{"i":48,"text":"How it works: an AI chatbot answers exactly what you ask. A clearer prompt (who it is for, which language, how long, what format, what role) gets a clearer answer.","where":"ui:g.luto.recap.how"},
{"i":49,"text":"The ingredient you missed most: {name} ({times}).","where":"ui:g.luto.recap.missed"},
