{"i":129,"text":"You decided {times} without proof from a check. A guess can be right, but it is still a guess: a clone sounds just like family.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.guesses"},
{"i":130,"text":"How it works: AI can copy a voice from a short clip, so a voice that sounds like family is not proof. Scammers fake hospital emergencies, a doctor or a bank to rush you.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.how"},
{"i":131,"text":"Never share an OTP or PIN, and never stop prescribed medicine because of a call or an ad. Real emergencies can wait for a two-minute check, and real family will understand.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.otp"},
{"i":132,"text":"Every decision had proof from a check. That is the habit that protects you.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.proof"},
{"i":133,"text":"Tip: set up a family secret question today. Only your family should know the answer.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.tip"},
{"i":134,"text":"You took {calls}: {stopped} stopped, {helped} helped, {paid} you helped and {hungUp} you hung up on. Best streak: {best}.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.took"},
{"i":135,"text":"Verify through a number or a person you already know: call back the saved number, ask another relative, use the official hotline. Never use a number the caller gives you.","where":"ui:g.sino.recap.verify"},
